  "description": "Kang Hoe-Yoon is the most captivating storyteller in all of Joseon. Wherever he goes, crowds gather to hear his thrilling tales. But he feels self-conscious whenever he notices the handsome Shin Eun-Ro in the audience, an aristocrat he harbors a secret crush on. However, one day, Eun-Ro approaches Hoe-Yoon with a bizarre request. Eun-Ro wants him to teach his future wife the \"art of love,\" fearing she’s too innocent for marriage. \n\nWill this be Hoe-Yoon's chance to get closer to his crush, or will it be a disaster that leaves him heartbroken?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
